{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b539d91a-124f-8ae6-bce9-6adba7a34aa9",
  "created_at": "2026-01-22T14:28:56-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Beatriz Herrera",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:21:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:21:16-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes, my name is Beatriz Herrera. I am calling about the recycling. I do not understand what is allowed now. I got a flyer in the mail and then I read something online and they do not say the same thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:21:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure, I can help with that. What are you trying to figure out? What items?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:21:40-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pizza boxes. Glass. And the plastic clamshells, the ones from the grocery store with the berries or the salad. I put all of it in the blue bin for years. Now I am told maybe I should not."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:21:55-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so let's take them one at a time. Pizza boxes, if they're clean, mostly cardboard, those are fine. But if the bottom is soaked with grease and cheese stuck on, that part goes in the trash. A lot of people tear off the clean lid and recycle that and trash the greasy bottom."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:22:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the top is recycling and the bottom is trash."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:22:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If the bottom's greasy, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:22:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And if it is only a little greasy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:22:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little spot is usually okay. Real saturated, no."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:22:32-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. That is not what the flyer says. The flyer says no pizza boxes. Maybe I have the old flyer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:22:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be. Do you see a date on it anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:22:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One moment. [pause] It says two thousand nineteen at the bottom. Yes. So it is old."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:22:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would do it. Go ahead and toss that one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:22:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Now the glass. Is glass still in the bin. I heard that glass goes somewhere else now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:23:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Glass bottles and jars are still accepted in the recycling. Rinse them out, lids off. Just no broken window glass, drinking glasses, or ceramics, those don't go in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:23:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Drinking glasses are not the same as jars."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:23:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Different kind of glass. Jars and bottles only."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:23:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And the clamshells."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:23:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Those are the tricky ones. The clear plastic containers, it depends on the number on the bottom, the little triangle with a number in it. Do you have one handy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:23:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have one in the kitchen. Hold on. [pause] I am walking. It says, in the triangle, fifteen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:23:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fifteen? Hmm, the numbers only go from one to seven. Is it maybe a one and a five? Or could it be a five?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:23:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It looks like fifteen. One, five. Wait. I am reading it again. Maybe it says fifty. I thought you said fifty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:24:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I didn't say fifty, I said the numbers only go up to seven. Look inside the little triangle. There should be just one digit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:24:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a one in the triangle. And next to it there are letters. P E T. And the five is on the lid, a different number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:24:28-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that makes sense. So the container is a number one, PET, and the lid is a number five. The number one container is generally fine to recycle. The lid, put it in too if it's a five, but if you're not sure, loose lids are better kept on the bottle or container."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:24:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The lid goes on the container."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:24:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For bottles, yes, lids back on. For the clamshells, they're hinged anyway, so just close it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:24:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am sorry. So fifteen is not a number. It is a one, and a five somewhere else."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:25:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. One on the container, five on the lid."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:25:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. I think I understand. Not entirely. But more than before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:25:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Is there anything that's actually been left behind, like a bin that wasn't picked up? Or is this just questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:25:25-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There was a tag on my bin last week. A orange tag. It said something about contamination. I did not understand that either. That is why I started to look at the flyer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:25:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, okay. That's the crew letting you know something in the bin wasn't accepted. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:25:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "409 Gibbs Avenue. On the Ocean Drive side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:25:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 409 Gibbs. And did the tag say what the problem was?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:25:55-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It had boxes with checks. I do not know which one was checked. It was wet from the rain. I think maybe it said plastic bags. But I do not use plastic bags in the bin. I use the paper bags. Or maybe I do use one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:26:13-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, plastic bags are a big one. People bag their recyclables and the bag goes in, and they can't take it. Everything should go in loose. Paper bags also should be left out, really. Just loose in the bin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:26:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Loose. Not in a paper bag."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:26:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Loose."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:26:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm. So I may have been doing it wrong for a long time and no one said anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:26:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, the rules have tightened up, so it's not just you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:26:46-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would like someone to call me back. A supervisor. I would like to hear it from someone who can tell me exactly what the tag meant, and whether my bin was picked up or not. Because it is still outside and it is still full."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:27:04-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can ask a supervisor to call you. I'll note that your bin has the orange tag from last week and you want to know what it was flagged for. Is this the best number? Starting with four zero one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:27:20-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four zero one, five five five, zero one five seven. It is my cell. I will answer if I am home. If not please leave the message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:27:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, four oh one, five five five, oh one five seven. And that's Beatriz Herrera, H-E-R-R-E-R-A?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:27:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Beatriz with a z at the end."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:27:42-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. They'll probably call you in the next day or two. In the meantime, if your bin's still full, I'd pull out any plastic bags and take things out of paper bags, and put them back in loose. Next pickup is probably okay then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:28:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The next pickup is Tuesday, I think. Or is it Wednesday. They changed the schedule for the holiday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:28:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The supervisor can confirm that too. I'll put it in the note."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:28:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. That would be good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:28:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And just to go over it once more: clean pizza box tops, glass jars and bottles, number one clamshell containers, all loose, no bags."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:28:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pizza box tops. Glass jars and bottles. The one. Not the fifty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:28:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not the fifty, there's no fifty. Number one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:28:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I will write it on a paper and put it on the refrigerator."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:28:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good idea. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:28:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That is all. Thank you for explaining."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:28:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Herrera. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:28:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
